     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Observation environment-conditions-example</b></p><a name=\"environment-conditions-example\"> </a><a name=\"hcenvironment-conditions-example\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #fbffeb; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-irun-environment-conditions.html\">Interoperability Run - environmental conditions</a></p></div><blockquote><p><b>Interoperability Run context</b></p><ul><li>eventType: <a href=\"CodeSystem-irun-event-type.html#irun-event-type-wgm\">Interoperability Run - event type: wgm</a> (HL7 Working Group Meeting)</li><li>eventName: HL7 Europe WGM Malaga 2026</li><li>phase: <a href=\"CodeSystem-irun-phase.html#irun-phase-during-run\">Interoperability Run - measurement phase: during-run</a> (During the run)</li><li>location: <a href=\"Location-malaga-course-example.html\">Malaga seafront run course</a></li></ul></blockquote><p><b>status</b>: Final</p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://example.org/ig/interoperabilityrun/CodeSystem/irun-exercise environment-conditions}\">Environmental conditions</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: <a href=\"Location-malaga-course-example.html\">Malaga seafront run course</a></p><p><b>effective</b>: 2026-11-18 07:30:00+0100</p><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://example.org/ig/interoperabilityrun/CodeSystem/irun-exercise air-temperature}\">Air temperature</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 14 °C<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codeCel = 'Cel')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://example.org/ig/interoperabilityrun/CodeSystem/irun-exercise relative-humidity}\">Relative humidity</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 72 %<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  code% = '%')</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>component</b></p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{https://example.org/ig/interoperabilityrun/CodeSystem/irun-exercise water-temperature}\">Water temperature</span></p><p><b>value</b>: 18 °C<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codeCel = 'Cel')</span></p></blockquote></div>"
